{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>עד אמונים</b> — a noun, meaning: a witness who speaks truth." "<b>לא יכזב</b> — at the time of need." "<b>ויפיח</b> — [it means] a speaker. And so, עד שקר יפיח כזבים is: a false witness breathes lies [i.e., יפיח here carries the same sense as in the lemma]."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:39.197997525Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}